      "comment": "STONE WRITER (1) resumes from a spell of 14 months after closing off last campaign in good form, the last run being a solid second over 2090m at this track. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Well-placed to take this out. MY BEAUTIFUL LIFE (3) continued a strong run of recent form and deserved her win last time out, scoring by 10 metres over 2090m at this track. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Tackles a similar assignment and she can go right on with the job. TALK IS CHEAP (5) is on the radar after her last-start fourth over 1680m at Launceston three-and-a-half weeks ago. EYE SEE AMOUR (6) is in the mix after turning in a better effort last start to finish third at Burnie over 2180m.",
